      "writtenOn": "2026-09-18T18:03:33Z",
      "side": 0,
      "message": "I would have thought this was the same or more conservative to the `(rad \u003c\u003d max - min)` case in `are_radius_check_predicates_valid`.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 769,
        "startChar": 8,
